SUMMARY:(6475) Refugium hides a mag 11.3 star (just outside the path)
DESCRIPTION:(6475) Refugium hides a magnitude 11.3 star\, seen from Ahmedab
 ad.\nThe predicted edge passes 12 km to the NNW\, so a miss is likely — 
 but a chord from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nC
 losest approach 05:22:14 IST\, give or take 1 s. The star is 43° up in th
 e ENE · dark sky.\nIt fades 5.9 magnitudes for up to 0.9 s on the centre 
 line\, and the path is 30 km wide\, give or take 25 km.\nThe map\, the fin
 der chart and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroid?e=2027-08
 -24-6475-refugium-062528
